abstract: "Toolkit for handling time-resolved ultrafast X-ray free-electron laser (XFEL) data, tailored to data from the Pohang Accelerator Laboratory (PAL-XFEL). It builds on and refactors the legacy XFEL_data codebase by Kim Jooheun."
